<title>THAILAND: Thai March C/A deficit widens to 15.9 bln baht.</title>
<headline>Thai March C/A deficit widens to 15.9 bln baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's March current account deficit widened to a preliminary 15.7 billion baht from a 14.7 billion baht deficit in February, the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    C/A DEFICIT	  March 97	Feb 97	March 96</p>
<p>				 15.9	   14.7	   39.6</p>
<p>Note - Figures in billions of baht.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 6520642</p>
</text>
